{"time": "20261117T172844Z", "think": "Took the stone with no trouble; the tablet warns not to lift the Eye.", "command": "answer 1. I now hold two seal-stones (Blackrose and Gemin). The tablet says the Eye, used where it sits, strengthens every tree, but lifted from its place it cuts every tree off from the others and the weak die. So I must use it in place, not take it. 2. Get the third stone from the deepest hall of Vorannuhl (boat, near Noota Nara), then open the Kings Gate under Teku-Sul Spire from Bell Station. 3. Fight or sneak through Vorannuhl; the Unbound and the Collector are rivals who may want the stones. 4. I do not know why the Unbound seal trees, or what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar. I can ask people like Nesh-Deeka.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 91, "at": "gemin", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn15.tablet-read": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-wo