{"time": "20261117T172848Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer I hold two seal-stones (Blackrose and Gemin), about 350 gold, Reel-Ka armour, rapier, 2 lockpicks, 3 paralysis poisons, sap jar, keystone, eye-setting. The Gemin tablet warns: use the Eye in place at the Root and it strengthens every tree; lift it out and all trees are cut off from each other and the weak die. So never lift it. Still needed: third stone in the deepest hall of Vorannuhl (boat, near Noota Nara); then all three go into the Kings Gate under Teku-Sul Spire (dive from Bell Station). The Unbound and the Collector (Ennodius Vanin, at Blackrose) are rivals. At Gemin I took the stone without a fight; the Warden would not talk. Open questions: why the Unbound seal trees, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, how Nesh-Deeka knows about the Unbound.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 91, "at": "gemin", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn15.tablet-read": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work",